{"title":"Career Roadmap: Corporate Governance Manager","role":"Corporate Governance Manager","summary":"Career Domain: Business, Finance & Entrepreneurship · Qualification Pathway: Professional Certifications - CA / CS / CMA / ACCA / CFA / CPA-India – Company Secretary (CS - ICSI) · Target Career: Corporate Governance Manager","facts":{"Current degree":"Professional Certifications - CA / CS / CMA / ACCA / CFA / CPA-India","Course":"Company Secretary (CS - ICSI)"},"about":[{"label":"About this roadmap","text":"This roadmap was drafted with AI assistance from OneGrasp's related roadmaps and is awaiting expert review. Check fees, dates, eligibility and exam patterns on the official websites before you rely on them."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Corporate Governance Manager makes sure a company's board and management follow the law and good governance - board meetings, disclosures, ethics and shareholder rights."},{"type":"h","text":"What a Corporate Governance Manager does"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Run board and committee meetings and minutes"},{"text":"Ensure Companies Act and SEBI LODR compliance"},{"text":"Manage disclosures and shareholder matters"},{"text":"Advise on governance policies"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Where they work:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Listed companies' secretarial teams"},{"text":"Large private companies"},{"text":"Law and governance advisory firms"},{"text":"Banks and NBFCs"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Career stage","Typical role"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry-level"},{"text":"Assistant Company Secretary"}],[{"text":"Early career"},{"text":"Company Secretary"}],[{"text":"Mid-level"},{"text":"Governance Manager"}],[{"text":"Senior"},{"text":"Head of Governance"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Chief Compliance Officer"}]]}]},{"heading":"Year-by-Year Learning Roadmap","kind":"build","bloc